GET {{baseUrl}}/dang-xuat.php

### TC04b - GET xoa san pham: mong doi 405
GET {{baseUrl}}/xoa-san-pham.php?id=0

### TC08a - Tham so tim kiem dang mang
GET {{baseUrl}}/danh-sach.php?q%5B%5D=ao

### TC08b - ID san pham dang mang
